{"id":"0f09dfa85ea5ca71","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-Induction.md","title":"Formula Induction Schema","display":"df-Induction — Formula Induction Schema","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-Induction","aliases":["62-df-Induction"],"display":"df-Induction — Formula Induction Schema","depends_on":["[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.2 (full induction scheme); Definition II.1.3","source_pages":[5,64],"source_pdf_pages":[23,82]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-Induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-Induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-Induction — Formula Induction Schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.2 (full induction scheme); Definition II.1.3"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>5</span><span>64</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>23</span><span>82</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in V_N\">\\(n\\in V_N\\)</span> 固定；全称闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/n]\">\\(\\varphi[t/n]\\)</span> 表示替换自由出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>；先把会捕获 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 中变量的绑定变量重命名为新变量，再按有限语法树递归替换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Induction}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}([\\varphi[0/n]\\land\\forall n(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[n+1/n])]\\to\\forall n\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Induction}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}([\\varphi[0/n]\\land\\forall n(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[n+1/n])]\\to\\forall n\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只在元层生成公理句子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 不是对象语言变量。替换防捕获。完整公式归纳、算术公式归纳和单个集合归纳公理的强度区别保留。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），§I.2 (full induction scheme); Definition II.1.3；纸面页 5, 64；PDF 页 23, 82。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}$，$n\\in V_N$ 固定；全称闭包见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\varphi[t/n]$ 表示替换自由出现的 $n$；先把会捕获 $t$ 中变量的绑定变量重命名为新变量，再按有限语法树递归替换。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[t/n]","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Induction}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}([\\varphi[0/n]\\land\\forall n(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[n+1/n])]\\to\\forall n\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1233,"backlinks":[{"id":"0f9bb628fd6df6ce","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"语法见 [[62-df-L2]]，基本公理 $\\mathrm Q_2$ 见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]，归纳生成算子 $\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-Induction]]，$\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]。$\\mathrm{PA}$、$\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1$ 在下式引入；所有公理通过同一签名嵌入 $L_2$。"},{"id":"3531afe9aa28ab10","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"基本公理见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]，归纳模式见 [[62-df-Induction]]，完整公式类见 [[62-df-L2]]。"},{"id":"e0e501d49d6a1513","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]；$\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-Induction]]。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-Induction|Formula Induction Schema]]"},{"id":"572865a260265c12","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-ACA0]]，$\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]，$\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-Induction]]，$\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-derivability]]。"}],"outgoing":["4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}